                </article>

                <article class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__card">
                  <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__h3">Map fields to columns</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__body">
                    Drag each form field to a monday column. The board's actual column names appear in the dropdown,
                    pulled live from monday. Standard fields (name, email, phone) auto-map. Set up the mapping once; the
                    integration remembers it for every future submission.
                  </p>
                  <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__visual" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map">
                      <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-row">
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-from">Full name</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-arrow">→</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to--text">Item name</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-row">
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-from">Lead status</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-arrow">→</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to--status">Status</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-row">
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-from">Budget</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-arrow">→</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to--number">Numbers</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-row">
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-from">Resume.pdf</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-arrow">→</span>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__map-to--file">Files</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </article>

                <article class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__card">
                  <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__h3">Submit a test response</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__body">
                    Fire a test response, confirm the new item appears on the right board with the right columns
                    populated and any file uploads attached, flip live.
                  </p>
                  <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__visual" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__confirm">
                      <svg
                        width="14"
                        height="14"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="2.4"
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                      >
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                      </svg>
                      Test item created on Inbound Leads
                    </div>
                    <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__confirm-item">
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__confirm-stripe"></span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__confirm-name">Test lead</span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__confirm-status">New</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </div>

              <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__cta-row">
                <a class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__cta" href="https://app.formester.com/users/sign_up">
                  Connect monday.com
                  <svg
                    width="16"
                    height="16"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2.2"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
                    <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
                  </svg>
                </a>
              </div>

              <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-set__fallback">
                Need more control? Formester also supports raw webhook and Zapier as fallbacks for power users. The
                native integration covers every flow listed on this page without either of them.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

