                          </span>
                          Formester → monday
                        </span>
                      </th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Multi-step forms with progress bar</td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__limited">Linear questions only</span></td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__yes">Yes, with branching steps</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Conditional logic across pages</td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__limited">Single-question show/hide</span></td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__yes">Full multi-field, multi-page</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Custom design (fonts, CSS, custom domain)</td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__limited">monday-branded</span></td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__yes">Full design control, white-label</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>File upload with size and type controls</td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__limited">Yes, monday's limits</span></td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__yes">Yes, configurable per field</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Payments (Stripe, PayPal)</td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__no">Not native</span></td>
                      <td>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__yes"
                          >Native, see
                          <a href="https://formester.com/features/online-order-form/">online order form</a></span
                        >
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>Signature capture</td>
                      <td><span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__no">No native field</span></td>
                      <td>
                        <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__yes"
                          >Yes, see
                          <a href="https://formester.com/features/electronic-signature/">electronic signature</a></span
                        >
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>

              <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-vs__takeaway">
                <strong>Takeaway:</strong> Internal team intake, WorkForms is fine. Anything customer-facing, branded,
                or money-handling, Formester sends to monday.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-component-item">
      <div class="raw-html-content">
        <div class="raw-html-embed">
          <section class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm" aria-labelledby="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm-h2">
            <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__container">
              <header class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__header">
                <h2 class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__h2" id="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm-h2">What the mapping looks like in practice</h2>
                <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__sub">Three boards Formester customers set up most often.</p>
              </header>

              <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__grid">
                <article class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__card">
                  <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__chip">Sales</span>
                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__h3">Sales lead routing</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__row">
                    <strong>Form:</strong> name, email, company, team size, budget, source (hidden UTM).
                  </p>
                  <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__board">
                    <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__board-name">Board · Inbound Leads</div>
                    <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__chips">
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--owner">Person</span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--status">Status: New</span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--drop">Source</span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--num">Budget</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </article>

                <article class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__card">
                  <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__chip">Agency</span>
                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__h3">Agency client intake</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__row">
                    <strong>Form:</strong> company, primary contact, project brief, deliverables (multi-select), budget,
                    deadline, brand assets (file upload).
                  </p>
                  <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__board">
                    <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__board-name">Board · New Engagements</div>
                    <div class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__chips">
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--status"
                        >Status: Briefing</span
                      >
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--date">Deadline</span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--file">Brand assets</span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--drop">Deliverables</span>
                      <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__col-chip--owner">Owner</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </article>

                <article class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__card">
                  <span class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__chip">HR</span>
                  <h3 class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__h3">Candidate applications</h3>
                  <p class="fmstr-cmp-mdy-fm__row">
                    <strong>Form:</strong> name, email, role applied for, resume (PDF), portfolio link, years
                    experience.
                  </p>
